{"headword":"מִמְכָּר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">Lv 25:28</a></sup> <strong>sale, ware</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.14\">Lv 25:14</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכַּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">Lv 25:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.27\">Lv 25:27</a> + 3 times; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> (but v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫כֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶכֶר</a>);—<em>sale</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.27\">Lv 25:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:50\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.50\">50</a>; <em>thing sold</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.14\">Lv 25:14</a> (acc. cogn.), v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">28</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.13\">Ez 7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.20\">Ne 13:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכַּר בַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">Lv 25:33</a> (Hex. only PH). On <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫כֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶכֶר</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB05396","strong_numbers":["4465"],"next_hw":"מִמְכֶּ֫רֶת","prev_hw":"מִכְרִי","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4928"],"TWOT":["1194b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}